  "notes": [
    "Annotation cues are cumulative reading memory for both quick and deep annotation commands, not a fixed taxonomy.",
    "When a paper or user conversation reveals a useful phrase, append it here instead of editing regexes in scripts.",
    "Quick annotation uses these cues for tool-assisted candidate selection after whole-section reading.",
    "Deep annotation uses these cues as reminders for close reading, but model judgment must override keyword matches.",
    "Keep entries short, lower-case when possible, and domain-specific only when they repeatedly help retrieval."
